# INVWINPM.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the pick lists at
# level 1.  The reader's item form shows an item with no "..." button
# and CTRL-E is refused; Find text's search dialog, whose fields can
# always be changed, has the buttons and F4 in Category and Location opens
# the lists.  CTRL-D is refused.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPM.SNP is its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
S LIST
K ENTER
S VIEW
K CTRL-E
S CTRLE
K ENTER ESC ALT-S T TAB TAB F4
S SRCHCAT
K DOWN ENTER
S SRCHCOK
K TAB F4 DOWN
S SRCHLOC
K ENTER
S SRCHLOK
K ESC CTRL-D
S NODUP
K ENTER ALT-F X
